{"id":"f9a3c4a1ebd2b711","group":"90","path":"90/90-lem-lob.md","title":"Löb Derivation","display":"lem-lob — Löb Derivation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-lem-lob","aliases":["90-lem-lob"],"display":"lem-lob — Löb Derivation","depends_on":["[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-hbl-conditions]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-lem-lob"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-lem-lob</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-lob — Löb Derivation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,S,g,d\">\\(T,S,g,d\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(v)\">\\(P(v)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_P\">\\(\\Box_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\land\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\n\\bigl(T\\vdash(\\Box_P A\\to A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\land\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\n\\bigl(T\\vdash(\\Box_P A\\to A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\Box_P A\\to A\">\\(T\\vdash\\Box_P A\\to A\\)</span>。对公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(v)\\to A\">\\(P(v)\\to A\\)</span> 用对角引理取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash D\\leftrightarrow(\\Box_P D\\to A)\">\\(T\\vdash D\\leftrightarrow(\\Box_P D\\to A)\\)</span>。以下全部是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中的推导：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD&amp;\\to(\\Box_P D\\to A),\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to\\Box_P(\\Box_P D\\to A),\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to(\\Box_P\\Box_P D\\to\\Box_P A),\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to\\Box_P\\Box_P D,\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to\\Box_P A,\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD&amp;\\to(\\Box_P D\\to A),\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to\\Box_P(\\Box_P D\\to A),\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to(\\Box_P\\Box_P D\\to\\Box_P A),\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to\\Box_P\\Box_P D,\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to\\Box_P A,\\\\\n\\Box_P D&amp;\\to A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第二行由第一条 HBL 与第二条 HBL，第三行由第二条 HBL，第四行由第三条 HBL，末行再用假设。固定点等价的反向于是给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash D\">\\(T\\vdash D\\)</span>；第一条 HBL 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\Box_P D\">\\(T\\vdash\\Box_P D\\)</span>，再用末行得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash A\">\\(T\\vdash A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同时需要固定点能力和三个推导条件；仅有一个 Henkin 固定点等价不足以替代对辅助固定点的需求。此引理不要求一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-hbl-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8d9c15743f7342d2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-hbl-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,S,g,d$ 满足 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的 $\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)$；$P(v)$、$\\Box_P$、$\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)$ 见 [[90-df-hbl-conditions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-hbl-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8d9c15743f7342d2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,S,g,d$ 满足 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的 $\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)$；$P(v)$、$\\Box_P$、$\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)$ 见 [[90-df-hbl-conditions]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,S,g,d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"P(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\land\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\n\\bigl(T\\vdash(\\Box_P A\\to A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash A\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\Box_P A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"P(v)\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash D\\leftrightarrow(\\Box_P D\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD&\\to(\\Box_P D\\to A),\\\\\n\\Box_P D&\\to\\Box_P(\\Box_P D\\to A),\\\\\n\\Box_P D&\\to(\\Box_P\\Box_P D\\to\\Box_P A),\\\\\n\\Box_P D&\\to\\Box_P\\Box_P D,\\\\\n\\Box_P D&\\to\\Box_P A,\\\\\n\\Box_P D&\\to A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash D","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\Box_P D","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash A","display":false}],"bytes":1477,"backlinks":[{"id":"3a69a5b2bc6a0fd7","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Henkin 等价给出 $T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(H)})\\to H$。对同一 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 及 $H$ 应用 [[90-lem-lob]]。"},{"id":"7145c12676268ab1","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"若 $T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_T$，则由其定义 $T\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\bot)})$，纯逻辑给出 $T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\bot)})\\to\\bot$。以 $A=\\bot$ 应用 [[90-lem-lob]]，得到 $T\\vdash\\bot$，与 $\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)$ 矛盾。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-lem-kleene-normal.md]]\n[[90-lem-lob.md]]\n[[90-lem-norm-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-lem-parameterized-recursion.md]]\n[[90-lem-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-lem-q-finite-comparison.md]]\n[[90-lem-sequence-coding.md]]\n[[90-lem-substitution.md]]\n[[90-lem-t-predicate.md]]"}],"outgoing":["f57084ad3c1a7029","8d9c15743f7342d2","b7d96c072a4c677f"]}